[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7200.149, "timestamp": "02:00:00", "text": "哦，我需要一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7205.03, "timestamp": "02:00:05", "text": "需要使用 Zoom 接收器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7209.669, "timestamp": "02:00:09", "text": "把那东西寄过去。好了，成功了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7212.149, "timestamp": "02:00:12", "text": "好吧，然后就是肖恩那件事了。我们开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7214.629, "timestamp": "02:00:14", "text": "去做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7218.07, "timestamp": "02:00:18", "text": "所以，要么是那个团体的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7221.91, "timestamp": "02:00:21", "text": "是什么原因导致了这种情况，还是其他原因？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7224.87, "timestamp": "02:00:24", "text": "不管怎样。我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7228.229, "timestamp": "02:00:28", "text": "我绕了一圈。好的。呃，哪一个？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7230.55, "timestamp": "02:00:30", "text": "你想要吗？呃，还有装饰品"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7234.149, "timestamp": "02:00:34", "text": "阿拉伯人也告诉我了。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7236.95, "timestamp": "02:00:36", "text": "让我看看你的 Twitch 个人资料。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7238.55, "timestamp": "02:00:38", "text": "轮廓。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7240.47, "timestamp": "02:00:40", "text": "你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7243.99, "timestamp": "02:00:43", "text": "这是一只猫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7251.109, "timestamp": "02:00:51", "text": "嗨，等等，我忘了。我为什么要放它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7254.47, "timestamp": "02:00:54", "text": "这边？哦，不。它应该是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7257.12, "timestamp": "02:00:57", "text": "这边。"}]